  "benefits": "\n- The project cost is ₹50,00,000/-\n\n> **RAS (Recirculating Aquaculture System) Subsidy:**\n\n\n1. A 20% subsidy is available for the General Category.\n1. A 25% subsidy is offered for SC (Scheduled Caste) and Women beneficiaries.\n\n> **Biofloc Subsidy:**\n\n\n1. A 40% subsidy is available for the General Category.\n1. A 60% subsidy is offered for SC (Scheduled Caste) and Women beneficiaries.\n\n",
